"Dried spirit-herb smoke drives a newly awakened beast off, its Qi offending the beast."
"Granny Hua keeps a dried bundle of a spirit herb, unlabeled, left to her by her teacher."
"She has never burned it, not knowing what it is, and thinks it a keepsake."
"A bundle of Moon-Dew Orchid burned at the wall would hold Old Tusk off the terraces for a night."
"The orchids by his wallow would serve the same way, if someone dared gather them."
